ocess running\" is NOT \"working.\"\n\n- **Redirect stdin every launch.** With a piped stdin, exec prints `Reading\n  additional input from stdin...` and blocks forever — the most common hang.\n  Always `codex exec ... < /dev/null` (with `nohup`/`&` as needed).\n- **Watchdog:** put a unique marker in the prompt, then kill the exec if\n  `grep -rl \"<marker>\" ~/.codex/sessions/<Y/M/D>/` finds no session within\n  ~3 minutes. Relaunching after a kill reliably works.\n- **Trust the worktree.** Headless exec in a directory Codex doesn't trust can\n  block forever on an invisible prompt. Git worktrees are separate paths from\n  the trusted repo root — add\n  `[projects.\"<worktree-path>\"]\\ntrust_level = \"trusted\"` to\n  `~/.codex/config.toml` before exec'ing in one. This is the safe fix; the\n  bypass flags stay forbidden here.\n- **Don't launch two execs in the same instant,** and kill stale hung execs\n  before starting a new one.\n- **Long prompts via file:** `codex exec ... \"$(cat prompt.txt)\"` — check the\n  file exists first; a missing file silently sends the fallback string as the\n  task.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Don't touch the working tree while a Codex exec is running on it.\n- `--sandbox read-only` (the default) for consultation and questions;\n  `workspace-write` only for delegated implementation.\n- `--dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox` is reserved for tasks that must\n  run browsers/servers/full suites (above) — dedicated worktree, self-authored\n  prompt, mandatory diff review after. `--full-auto` is deprecated (just an\n  alias for workspace-write) — don't reach for it.\n- Leave `--effort` unset (accepted: none, minimal, low, medium, high, xhigh)\n  and omit model overrides unless the user asks — tighten the prompt first.\n","total_lines":138}},"locations":[]}
+{"type":"available_commands","tools":["read_file","list_dir","grep","search_tool","use_tool","codex__codex","codex__codex-reply","railway__add_reference_variable","railway__connect_service_source","railway__create_bucket","railway__create_environment","railway__create_project","railway__create_service","railway__create_tcp_proxy","railway__create_volume","railway__delete_domain","railway__deploy","railway__deploy_template","railway__disconnect_service_source","railway__docs_fetch","railway__docs_search","railway__domain_status","railway__environment_status","railway__generate_domain","railway__get_logs","railway__get_service_config","railway__get_tcp_proxy","railway__http_error_rate","railway__http_requests","railway__http_response_time","railway__link_environment","railway__link_service","railway__list_deployments","railway__list_domains","railway__list_projects","railway__list_services","railway__list_tcp_proxies","railway__list_variables","railway__list_workspaces","railway__private_network_status","railway__private_network_update","railway__remove_bucket","railway__remove_service","railway__remove_tcp_proxy","railway__remove_volume","railway__retry_domain_certificate","railway__scale_service","railway__search_templates","railway__service_metrics","railway__set_variables","railway__update_domain","railway__update_service","railway__update_volume","railway__whoami","react-grab-mcp__get_element_context"],"commands":["compact","always-approve","context","hooks-trust","hooks-list","hooks-add","hooks-remove","hooks-untrust","plugins","reload-plugins","session-info","feedback","goal","codex","brave-search","close-spec","compare-screenshots","dep-tldr","eval-skills","feature-slicing","find-skills","implement-spec","instruments-profiling","llm-tldr-dep-indexer","llm-tldr-usage","oracle","preview-shots","refactor-clean","renderer","screenshot-critique","skill-creator","swift-concurrency-expert","swiftui-liquid-glass","swiftui-performance-audit","swiftui-view-refactor","u